<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="504492138"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1835864726"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Crime"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Grey / Skott"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Crime"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:55.363"><div begin="00:11.523" end="02:42.465"><p begin="00:11.523" end="00:14.522" itunes:key="L1">Tippy toeing down your spine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当所有人都在旁边 踮起脚尖尽情舒展</span></p><p begin="00:14.522" end="00:17.066" itunes:key="L2">When everyone's around</p><p begin="00:17.160" end="00:21.553" itunes:key="L3">Kiss me hard, forget them judging eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深情吻我 忘却旁人评判的目光</span></p><p begin="00:22.902" end="00:26.498" itunes:key="L4">Who cares about what is to come?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁会在乎未来将发生什么 我不惧怕黑夜</span></p><p begin="00:26.498" end="00:29.043" itunes:key="L5">No, I don't fear the night</p><p begin="00:29.304" end="00:33.495" itunes:key="L6">Let's show 'em what it is to be alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我们来告诉他们 什么才叫做活着</span></p><p begin="00:35.617" end="00:39.671" itunes:key="L7">If nothing is for keeps, can I keep you just for a minute?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果没有什么能永久 我能否将你留在身边一分钟</span></p><p begin="00:41.548" end="00:45.536" itunes:key="L8">I don't know what's real, but I really wanna feel you now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道什么才是真 可我现在真的想感受你的存在</span></p><p begin="00:47.450" end="00:51.653" itunes:key="L9">Get a little too close, can I stop your heart for a moment?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离我近一些 我能否在你心尖片刻停留</span></p><p begin="00:53.130" end="00:57.463" itunes:key="L10">If I don't even care, is that really such a crime?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我毫不在意 那真的算是罪过么</span></p><p begin="01:08.213" end="01:12.482" itunes:key="L11">If I don't even care, is that really such a crime?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我毫不在意 那真的算是罪过么</span></p><p begin="01:20.304" end="01:24.500" itunes:key="L12">If I don't even care, is that really such a crime?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我毫不在意 那真的算是罪过么</span></p><p begin="01:23.679" end="01:26.438" itunes:key="L13">Shed your layer, lay with me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宽衣解带 与我同眠 让我们共度美好时光</span></p><p begin="01:26.438" end="01:28.947" itunes:key="L14">Let's waste a little time</p><p begin="01:29.371" end="01:31.689" itunes:key="L15">And if it all burns down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果一切都燃烧殆尽 其实那才是人生本色</span></p><p begin="01:31.689" end="01:33.295" itunes:key="L16">Well, that's just life</p><p begin="01:35.623" end="01:39.313" itunes:key="L17">Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反正我们都会义无反顾</span></p><p begin="01:39.313" end="01:41.859" itunes:key="L18">We're all going anyway</p><p begin="01:42.101" end="01:45.430" itunes:key="L19">So let's let it out to love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让你我尽情释放自己</span></p><p begin="01:47.483" end="01:51.627" itunes:key="L20">If nothing is for keeps, can I keep you just for a minute?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果没有什么能永久 我能否将你留在身边一分钟</span></p><p begin="01:53.454" end="01:57.474" itunes:key="L21">I don't know what's real, but I really wanna feel you now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道什么才是真 可我现在真的想感受你的存在</span></p><p begin="01:59.355" end="02:03.686" itunes:key="L22">Get a little too close, can I stop your heart for a moment?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离我近一些 我能否在你心尖片刻停留</span></p><p begin="02:05.188" end="02:09.480" itunes:key="L23">If I don't even care, is that really such a crime?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我毫不在意 那真的算是罪过么</span></p><p begin="02:11.230" end="02:15.375" itunes:key="L24">If I don't even care, is that really such a crime?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我毫不在意 那真的算是罪过么</span></p><p begin="02:26.208" end="02:30.441" itunes:key="L25">If I don't even care, is that really such a crime?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我毫不在意 那真的算是罪过么</span></p><p begin="02:38.247" end="02:42.465" itunes:key="L26">If I don't even care, is that really such a crime?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若我毫不在意 那真的算是罪过么</span></p></div></body></tt>